# Changeling is a characteristic-defining ability (CR 702.73a) and applies in layer 4 before a loses-all-abilities effect
# applies in layer 6 (CR 613.1d, 613.1f, 613.3; Firdoch Core's ruling): The Wondrous Wasp takes the animated Core's
# abilities - Changeling is no longer among its keywords - and it is still every creature type, an outlaw Shoot the
# Sheriff may not destroy. It also has no abilities left to activate (its {4} and its mana ability). Bot1 animates
# the Core on turn 3 with Sol Ring and two Moxen, then flashes the Wasp in with Mox Sapphire and a Swamp.

