Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Sol Ring
Firdoch Core
Mox Sapphire
The Wondrous Wasp
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Shoot the Sheriff
Swamp x12

